message: "If you use the FIELD Framework or FDE Delivery Maturity Model, please cite this repository."
title: "Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) Field Guide"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ding
    given-names: Bosheng
    website: "https://www.boshengding.com/"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual, source-backed field guide to Forward Deployed Engineering for
  production AI and LLM systems. It covers role boundaries, customer discovery,
  architecture, AI agents, RAG, evaluation, observability, security, adoption,
  GTM, post-training, career preparation, reusable delivery templates, and
  Bosheng Ding's original FIELD Framework and FDE Delivery Maturity Model.
url: "https://github.com/Bosheng2020/fde-field-guide"
